DOCUMENT();
loadMacros(
"PGstandard.pl",
"MathObjects.pl",
"PGML.pl"
);
Context("Numeric");
Context()->flags->set(reduceConstantFunctions=>0);
Context()->flags->set(reduceConstants=>0);

$fun_2 = Formula("9/((x^2+4*x+1))");
$fun_1 = Formula("((((x^2-5*x+3))^2))^2");

Context("Interval");

$set_ans_3 = Compute("{-5, 9} U {-5, 9} U (-infinity, 15)");
$set_ans_4 = Compute("{-4, -1, 7} U {-5, 9} U ((-infinity, 15))");
$set_ans_1 = Compute("(-infinity, 18] U [5, infinity)");
$set_ans_2 = Compute("((-infinity, 18] U [5, infinity)) U (-infinity, 18] U [5, infinity) U [5, infinity)");

Context("Vector");

BEGIN_PGML
# Questions:

_For arithmetic problems, if the result is not an integer, then retain *three significant digits*._

[`19+10+14`] is equal to [_____]{answer=>Real(43.),width=>1}
---

What is the value of [`11*3+3`]? [_____]{answer=>36,width=>10}
---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{x | x \geq 5\}`]
- [`B = \{x | x \leq 18\}`]

Compute:
- [`B \cup A = `] [_____]{$set_ans_1}
- [`(B \cup A) \cup B \cup A \cup A = `] [_____]{$set_ans_2}

---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{-5, 9\}`]
- [`B = \{x | x < 15\}`]
- [`C = \{-4, -1, 7\}`]

Compute:
- [`A \cup A \cup B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_3}
- [`C \cup A \cup (B) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_4}

---

Suppose the vectors:
- [` \vec{u} = \langle -10, 9, 2 \rangle `]
- [` \vec{v} = \langle 1, 4, -3 \rangle `]

Compute:
- [` \vec{u} \times \vec{v} = `] [_____]{Compute("<-10, 9, 2>") x Compute("<1, 4, -3>")}
- Enter a unit vector in the direction of [` \vec{v} `]. [_____]{unit(Compute("<1, 4, -3>"))}
- Enter a vector parallel to [` \vec{u} `]. [_____]{Compute("<-10, 9, 2>")->cmp(parallel=>1)}
- [` \left\| \vec{u} \right\| = `] [_____]{norm(Compute("<-10, 9, 2>"))}

---

Suppose the vectors:
- [` \vec{u} = \langle -6, -10, -9 \rangle `]
- [` \vec{v} = \langle 6, -2, -1 \rangle `]

Compute:
- [` \vec{u} \times \vec{v} = `] [_____]{Compute("<-6, -10, -9>") x Compute("<6, -2, -1>")}
- [` \left\| \vec{v} \right\| = `] [_____]{norm(Compute("<6, -2, -1>"))}
- [` \vec{u} \cdot \vec{v} = `] [_____]{Compute("<-6, -10, -9>") . Compute("<6, -2, -1>")}
- Enter a vector in the same direction as [` \vec{u} `]. [_____]{Compute("<-6, -10, -9>")->cmp(parallel=>1,sameDirection=>1)}
- Enter a vector in the same direction as [` \vec{v} `]. [_____]{Compute("<6, -2, -1>")->cmp(parallel=>1,sameDirection=>1)}

---

Given this function:

>> [`[$fun_1]`] <<

Compute:
- [`f'(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_1->D()}
- [`f'(0) =`] [_____]{$fun_1->D()->eval(x=>0)}
- [`f''(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_1->D()->D()}

---

Given this function:

>> [`[$fun_2]`] <<

Compute:
- [`f'(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_2->D()}
- [`f'(9) =`] [_____]{$fun_2->D()->eval(x=>9)}
- [`f'(2) =`] [_____]{$fun_2->D()->eval(x=>2)}

---
END_PGML
ENDDOCUMENT();
